{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53211","headline":"诗偈 三十六 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 三十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寅朝饮稀粥，饭後两束薪，货得二升米，支我有余身。\n身无饥火逼，安余无相神。\n神安佛土净，内外绝埃尘。\n无间说般若，豁达启关津。\n火烧家计尽，全成无事人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53211.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53211","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}